tui_fieldset with a completion callback and ";," separators.
The drop-down's keys differ by the owner's decision (see
.BR tui_fieldset_init (3)):
Enter accepts only a candidate the cursor was moved onto, and Tab fills in
the prefix all candidates share instead of accepting the first one.
